@page "/"

@attribute [Authorize]

<PageTitle>Overview | Mobility Finance</PageTitle>

<section class="page-heading">
    <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Operations overview</p>
        <h1>Mobility finance, in one operational view</h1>
        <p>Track financing, repayments, asset activation, and platform delivery without crossing service boundaries.</p>
    </div>
    <span class="environment-pill">Development</span>
</section>

<section class="metric-grid" aria-label="Platform metrics">
    <article class="metric-card">
        <span>Applications awaiting review</span>
        <strong>12</strong>
        <small>4 require action today</small>
    </article>
    <article class="metric-card">
        <span>Active agreements</span>
        <strong>1,284</strong>
        <small>98.6% current this cycle</small>
    </article>
    <article class="metric-card">
        <span>Activation workflows</span>
        <strong>31</strong>
        <small>3 in manual review</small>
    </article>
    <article class="metric-card">
        <span>Delivery health</span>
        <strong>99.98%</strong>
        <small>No unresolved dead letters</small>
    </article>
</section>

<section class="content-grid">
    <article class="panel panel-wide">
        <div class="panel-heading">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">Activation workflow</p>
                <h2>From accepted offer to active agreement</h2>
            </div>
            <span class="badge badge-success">Healthy</span>
        </div>
        <ol class="workflow-steps">
            <li class="complete"><span>1</span><strong>Offer accepted</strong></li>
            <li class="complete"><span>2</span><strong>Deposit recorded</strong></li>
            <li class="current"><span>3</span><strong>Asset assigned</strong></li>
            <li><span>4</span><strong>Agreement active</strong></li>
        </ol>
        <p class="muted">Workflow state, retries, deadlines, and review decisions will be projected here from service events.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="panel">
        <div class="panel-heading">
            <div>
                <p class="eyebrow">Control boundary</p>
                <h2>Human review by design</h2>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p>Sensitive simulated asset commands cannot be triggered by a missed payment. A reviewer must approve the reason and the system records an immutable audit event.</p>
        <AuthorizeView Policy="@AuthorizationPolicies.ReviewWork">
            <a class="text-link" href="/review">Open review queue →</a>
        </AuthorizeView>
    </article>
</section>
